# Keep the deployment payload to the app itself.
#
# scripts/ doubles as a scratch area for analysis work (weather archives,
# decks, exported reports) and had grown to ~1.6GB, which pushed deploys past
# Vercel's 100MB file limit. Only the build helper below is actually needed:
# package.json's prebuild runs scripts/generate-valid-multipart-path-prefixes.js.
# Everything else here is data, not app source.
scripts/nws-weather-data/
scripts/product-marketing/
scripts/weekly-summary-output/
scripts/weekly-summary-archive/
scripts/all-hands-slides/
scripts/mockups/
scripts/onboarding/
*.pptx
*.csv

# Local scratch and analysis, not part of the build
test_m4a/
tripwire-analysis/
.venv-docx/
.claude/
*.tsbuildinfo

# Local test/dev artifacts
src/app/__tests__/
